{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"linkUser"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"authCode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"completionHandler"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SENTUserLinkingResult","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserLinkingResult","text":"SENTUserLinkingResult"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserLinkingError","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SENTUserLinkingError","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SENTUserLinkingError"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":")? = nil)"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"linkUser"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"authCode","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SENTUserLinkingResult","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserLinkingResult","text":"SENTUserLinkingResult","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SENTUserLinkingError","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserLinkingError","text":"SENTUserLinkingError"},{"kind":"text","text":"?)"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A code obtained from the backend Sentiance API."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"authCode"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Links the Sentiance user to your app’s user, on the Sentiance Cloud Platform."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Uses the supplied authentication code to find the app user. Therefore, before calling this method, make sure that you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"have obtained a valid code from the backend Sentiance API (thereby having initiated the first linking step). This","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code request is authenticated using a Sentiance API key, which must never be transmitted to the app. Hence why the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request must come from your backend.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Here are the complete steps:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Retrieve the code in your app and supply it to this method."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Initiate an authentication code request via your backend towards the Sentiance backend. This request will include"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"your app’s user identifier, which will be temporarily coupled to the code that you will receive."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK will forward the code to the Sentiance backend to complete the link."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With this method, a Sentiance user cannot be linked to an app user that already exists on the Sentiance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Platform (i.e. with an app user identifier that you already supplied to Sentiance during a past authentication code"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request). You can only link to an app user that is new to Sentiance. This is because an existing app user will"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already have a corresponding Sentiance user on the platform, and that Sentiance user cannot be restored here anymore."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To restore that user, you must reset the SDK and recreate a linked Sentiance user instead."}]}],"type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method is useful if you want to link a Sentiance user that was previously created without specifying a linker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the user creation options (thereby having created an unlinked user)."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/Sentiance\/linkUser(authCode:completionHandler:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"linkUserWithAuthCode:completionHandler:"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)Sentiance(im)linkUserWithAuthCode:completionHandler:","title":"linkUser(authCode:completionHandler:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"SENTSDK"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"linkUser"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"authCode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"completionHandler"},{"kind":"text","text":": (("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","